  "post_title": "El Pabellón Municipal de Onda acoge el II open de Brazilian Jiu Jitsu",
  "post_date": "2012-11-10 15:44:41",
  "post_name": "el-pabellon-municipal-de-onda-acoge-el-ii-open-de-brazilian-jiu-jitsu",
