  "imagen_destacada_id": "NULL",
  "categorias": "Deportes|Noticias",
  "post_content": "<p>El Pabell&oacute;n&nbsp;Municipal de Onda&nbsp;acoge este&nbsp;s&aacute;bado el II open de Brazilian Jiu Jitsu, en el que participan unos 170 luchadores pdertenecientes a&nbsp;clubs de toda Espa&ntilde;a.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2012/11/IMG_7326.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>La prueba, como el <a href=\"http://www.eltriangulo.es/contenidos/?p=27934\" target=\"_blank\">I open de&nbsp;Brazilian Jiu Jitsu y Grappling</a>, que se realiz&oacute; en abril, est&aacute; organizada por el gimansio Kubotan de Onda , cuyo club de lucha obtiene excelentes resultados en Espa&ntilde;a y en Europa, principalmente con Juan Garc&iacute;a Garrido, Esther Gil Robles y Nazar Vintonyak.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/iiopenjiujitsu/img_7313.jpg\" alt=\"img_7313\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/iiopenjiujitsu/img_7314.jpg\" alt=\"img_7314\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/iiopenjiujitsu/img_7315.jpg\" alt=\"img_7315\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/iiopenjiujitsu/img_7316.jpg\" alt=\"img_7316\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/iiopenjiujitsu/img_7317.jpg\" alt=\"img_7317\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/iiopenjiujitsu/img_7318.jpg\" alt=\"img_7318\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/iiopenjiujitsu/img_7319.jpg\" alt=\"img_7319\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/iiopenjiujitsu/img_73